", "start": 2653.29, "end": 2653.75}, {"word": "to", "start": 2653.75, "end": 2653.99}, {"word": "provide", "start": 2653.99, "end": 2654.29}, {"word": "additional", "start": 2654.29, "end": 2654.81}, {"word": "funds.", "start": 2654.81, "end": 2655.25}, {"word": "The", "start": 2656.59, "end": 2656.89}, {"word": "tower", "start": 2656.89, "end": 2657.17}, {"word": "stopped.", "start": 2657.17, "end": 2657.63}]}, {"start": 2659.07, "end": 2662.71, "text": "Wardencliff was demolished for scrap during the First World War.", "no_speech_prob": 0.02, "words": [{"word": "Wardencliff", "start": 2659.07, "end": 2659.75}, {"word": "was", "start": 2659.75, "end": 2659.97}, {"word": "demolished", "start": 2659.97, "end": 2660.59}, {"word": "for", "start": 2660.59, "end": 2660.79}, {"word": "scrap", "start": 2660.79, "end": 2661.05}, {"word": "during", "start": 2661.05, "end": 2661.63}, {"word": "the", "start": 2661.63, "end": 2661.87}, {"word": "First", "start": 2661.87, "end": 2662.09}, {"word": "World", "start": 2662.09, "end": 2662.37}, {"word": "War.", "start": 2662.37, "end": 2662.71}]}, {"start": 2663.83, "end": 2671.21, "text": "The scrap did not cover what Tesla owed. From there. Hotels. A sequence of them.", "no_speech_prob": 0.02, "words": [{"word": "The", "start": 2663.83, "end": 2664.37}, {"word": "scrap", "start": 2664.37, "end": 2664.59}, {"word": "did", "start": 2664.59, "end": 2664.97}, {"word": "not", "start": 2664.97, "end": 2665.25}, {"word": "cover", "start": 2665.25, "end": 2665.67}, {"word": "what", "start": 2665.67, "end": 2665.97}, {"word": "Tesla", "start": 2665.97, "end": 2666.33}, {"word": "owed.", "start": 2666.33, "end": 2666.67}, {"word": "From", "start": 2667.81, "end": 2668.01}, {"word": "there.", "start": 2668.01, "end": 2668.31}, {"word": "Hotels.", "start": 2668.95, "end": 2669.45}, {"word": "A", "start": 2670.19, "end": 2670.45}, {"word": "sequence", "start": 2670.45, "end": 2670.71}, {"word": "of", "start": 2670.71, "end": 2671.05}, {"word"